 * {{Symbol|Aura}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|abyssal_underlord_atrophy_aura_effect}}
** Does not affect {{M|neutral creeps}}.
** The [[aura]] has three main components:
*** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|1|21px]] {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|abyssal_underlord_atrophy_aura_effect}}
**** Reduces {{M|main attack damage}}.
**** Stacks additively with other total attack damage reduction sources.
**** Does not affect bonus {{M|conditional attack damage}}.
**** Does not affect the following units:
***** {{Symbol|Vision|No}}
****** Enemy units that have no [[vision]] over Underlord.
***** {{M|Hidden}} units.
***** {{M|Invulnerable}} units.
*** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|2|21px]]
**** {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}} {{Symbol|Death}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Self}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Stack}} {{Symbol|Attack Damage|Bonus}}
***** Grants self a flat [[bonus attack damage]] stack per debuff-affected enemy unit upon its [[death]], including the following conditions:
****** From {{M|reincarnation}} sources.
****** Regardless if {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|abyssal_underlord_atrophy_aura_effect}} is present on the enemy unit's [[HUD]]
***** Considers {{A|Meepo|Meepo Clones}} as heroes, and {{M|creep-heroes}} as creeps.
***** The following units' death do not grant stacks:
****** {{M|Buildings}}
****** {{M|Couriers}}
****** {{M|The Double}}
****** {{M|Illusions}}
****** The {{U|Undying Zombie}}.
****** {{M|Ward-type units}}.
**** {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|abyssal_underlord_atrophy_aura_dmg_buff_counter}}
***** Each granted stack applies a buff on Underlord, with each buff duration independent of each other.

