| desc = [[Root]] sources interrupts the {{M|channeling}} component.
}}

fields.value:
 {{Teleportcard}}

* Considers allied {{M|clones}} and the {{H|Spirit Bear}} as heroes.

* Applies a generic {{M|incoming damage}} reduction on affected allied heroes.
** Stacks additively with other incoming damage manipulation sources.
** Does not affect {{M|HP Removal}} sources.

* {{cf|expr}}
** {{M|Incoming damage}} reduction: {{Code|({{#var:Invading Force value2}} + {{ValueColor||{{Show|T|Underlord|v1r}}%|tal|x}} + {{#var:Invading Force basic1}} × SelfLvl) × f([[#Fiend's Gate|FiendGate]])}}
** {{M|Movement speed}} bonus: {{Code|({{#var:Invading Force value2}} + {{ValueColor||{{Show|T|Underlord|v1r}}%|tal|x}} + {{#var:Invading Force basic2}} × SelfLvl) × f(FiendGate)}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Invading Force icon0}}
| desc = After an allied hero Teleports, they temporarily gain Damage Reduction and Movement Speed. Allies receive 2x bonuses if teleporting via Fiend's Gate.
}}

